	"boundaries": [
		"The production writer uses GCS. PostgreSQL recovery tests exercise the actual GCS HTTP adapter against a loopback wire fixture. The container operator uses an explicitly volatile journal fixture; container results do not establish GCS durability.",
		"Bounded reading, exact-generation integrity, 205-record pagination, uncertain upload/SQL acknowledgement, SQL rollback and cancellation were exercised. No SQL restore/replay runner or public reopening barrier is implemented.",
